### Product Catalog API (Spring MVC) - IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client
# Writes need a token: run `make token` (or scripts/dev-token.sh) and paste it below.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = PASTE_OUTPUT_OF_scripts/dev-token.sh

### List (JSON, page 0, 5 per page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?size=5
Accept: application/json

### Search: electronics 1000-9000 in stock, most expensive first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?category=electronics&minPrice=1000&maxPrice=9000&inStock=true&sort=price,desc&size=3
Accept: application/json

### Keyword search as plain text (?format overrides Accept)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?q=bottle&format=text

### Same list as XML
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?size=2
Accept: application/xml

### Same list as HTML (open the URL in a browser too)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?size=2
Accept: text/html

### One product (note the ETag, e.g. "1-0")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Conditional GET -> 304 when unchanged
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/1
If-None-Match: "1-0"

### Create (JSON) -> 201 + Location + ETag
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "FIT-KBEL-01", "name": "Kettlebell 8 kg", "category": "Fitness", "price": 1899.00, "stock": 25 }

### Create (XML)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/xml
Accept: application/xml

<product><sku>FIT-KBEL-02</sku><name>Kettlebell 12 kg</name><price>2499.00</price><stock>10</stock></product>

### Replace (PUT) with optimistic locking - use the ETag you read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/26
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "26-0"

{ "sku": "FIT-KBEL-01", "name": "Kettlebell 8 kg (cast iron)", "category": "Fitness", "price": 1999.00, "stock": 20 }

### Partial update (JSON merge patch); "" clears category
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/26
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/merge-patch+json

{ "stock": 0, "category": "" }

### Delete -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/26
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Errors: validation (400), no token (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "x", "name": "", "price": -1, "stock": -5 }

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "NO-TOKEN-01", "name": "No token", "price": 1, "stock": 1 }

### OpenAPI (group v1) and health
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs/v1

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health/readiness
